NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-create","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack create"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a new TanStack application. By default creates a TanStack Start app with SSR."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create [project-name] [options]","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--add-ons <ids>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Comma-separated add-on IDs"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--template <url-or-id>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Template URL/path or built-in template ID"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--blank"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a minimal one-route Start project without default starter UI, examples, Tailwind, devtools, or a test stack"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--package-manager <pm>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"npm"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pnpm"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"yarn"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"bun"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"deno"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--framework <name>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Solid"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--router-only"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create file-based Router-only app without TanStack Start (add-ons/deployment/template disabled)"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--toolchain <id>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Toolchain add-on (use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--list-add-ons"},{"type":"text","value":" to see options)"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--deployment <id>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deployment add-on (use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--list-add-ons"},{"type":"text","value":" to see options)"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--examples"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--no-examples"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include or exclude demo/example pages"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--tailwind"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--no-tailwind"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deprecated compatibility flags for standard projects; blank projects omit Tailwind"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--no-git"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Skip git init"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--no-install"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Skip dependency install"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"-y, --yes"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use defaults, skip prompts"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--interactive"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Force interactive mode"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--target-dir <path>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom output directory"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"-f, --force"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overwrite existing directory"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--list-add-ons"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"List all available add-ons"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--addon-details <id>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Show details for specific add-on"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--json"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output machine-readable JSON for automation"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--add-on-config <json>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"JSON string with add-on options"}]}]]},{"type":"code","value":"# Examples\ntanstack create my-app -y\ntanstack create my-app --blank -y\ntanstack create my-app --blank --deployment cloudflare -y\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons clerk,drizzle,tanstack-query\ntanstack create my-app --router-only --toolchain eslint --no-examples\ntanstack create my-app --template https://example.com/template.json\ntanstack create my-app --template ecommerce\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json\ntanstack create --addon-details drizzle --framework React --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--blank"},{"type":"text","value":" creates the smallest useful TanStack Start project: one route and no\ndefault starter interface, examples, Tailwind, devtools, test dependencies, or\nTanStack Intent setup. Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--intent"},{"type":"text","value":" when the project should include local\nskill mappings for coding agents.\nExplicit add-ons and deployment adapters can add their own required files and\ndependencies. Add "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"-y"},{"type":"text","value":" to use defaults for every remaining option; when the\ntarget is non-empty, also pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--force"},{"type":"text","value":" or the command exits without writing."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"programmatic-generation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Programmatic generation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/create/worker"},{"type":"text","value":" in Cloudflare Workers and other edge SSR runtimes. It does not import the generated template manifest at module startup. Instead, provide a loader for the framework and add-on chunks your Worker supports."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/create"},{"type":"text","value":" export is still the Node/CLI path and scans framework templates from disk. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/create/edge"},{"type":"text","value":" remains the bundled in-memory manifest path; it is Worker-compatible at runtime, but it imports the full generated manifest and is not appropriate for size-constrained Worker bundles."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  createMemoryEnvironment,\n  createWorkerCreate,\n  createWorkerManifestLoader,\n} from '@tanstack/create/worker'\nimport { manifestCatalog } from '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/catalog'\n\nimport type {\n  WorkerAddOnManifestModule,\n  WorkerFrameworkManifestModule,\n} from '@tanstack/create/worker'\n\nconst frameworkLoaders: Record<\n  string,\n  () => Promise<WorkerFrameworkManifestModule>\n> = {\n  react: () => import('@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react'),\n}\n\nconst addOnLoaders: Record<\n  string,\n  Record<string, () => Promise<WorkerAddOnManifestModule>>\n> = {\n  react: {\n    'tanstack-query': () =>\n      import(\n        '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react/add-ons/tanstack-query'\n      ),\n    cloudflare: () =>\n      import(\n        '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react/add-ons/cloudflare'\n      ),\n  },\n}\n\nconst create = createWorkerCreate(\n  createWorkerManifestLoader({\n    loadCatalog: async () => manifestCatalog,\n    async loadFramework(frameworkId) {\n      const load = frameworkLoaders[frameworkId]\n      if (!load) throw new Error(`Unsupported framework: ${frameworkId}`)\n      return load()\n    },\n    async loadAddOn(frameworkId, addOnId) {\n      const load = addOnLoaders[frameworkId]?.[addOnId]\n      if (!load) throw new Error(`Unsupported add-on: ${addOnId}`)\n      return load()\n    },\n  }),\n)\n\nconst framework = await create.getFrameworkById('react')\nconst chosenAddOns = await create.finalizeAddOns(framework!, 'file-router', [\n  'tanstack-query',\n  'cloudflare',\n])\nconst addOnOptions = create.populateAddOnOptionsDefaults(chosenAddOns)\nconst { environment, output } = createMemoryEnvironment('/app')\n\nawait create.createApp(environment, {\n  projectName: 'app',\n  targetDir: '/app',\n  framework: framework!,\n  mode: 'file-router',\n  typescript: true,\n  tailwind: true,\n  packageManager: 'pnpm',\n  git: false,\n  install: false,\n  intent: false,\n  chosenAddOns,\n  addOnOptions,\n})\n\n// output.files contains generated files for ZIP creation.","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-add","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack add"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add add-ons to an existing project."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack add [add-on...] [options]","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--forced"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Force add-on installation even if conflicts exist"}]}]]},{"type":"code","value":"# Examples\ntanstack add clerk drizzle\ntanstack add tanstack-query,tanstack-form","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Visual setup is available at "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"https://tanstack.com/builder"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-add-on","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack add-on"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create and manage custom add-ons."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"init","children":[{"type":"text","value":"init"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extract add-on from current project:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack add-on init","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".add-on/"},{"type":"text","value":" folder with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"info.json"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"assets/"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"compile","children":[{"type":"text","value":"compile"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rebuild after changes:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack add-on compile","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"./creating-add-ons.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creating Add-ons"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for full guide."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-template","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack template"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create reusable project templates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"init-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"init"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack template init","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"template-info.json"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"template.json"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"compile-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"compile"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack template compile","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"./templates.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Templates"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for full guide."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-libraries","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack libraries"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"List TanStack libraries with optional group filtering."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack libraries [options]","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--group <group>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filter by group: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"headlessUI"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"performance"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tooling"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--json"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output machine-readable JSON"}]}]]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack libraries\ntanstack libraries --group state --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-doc","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack doc"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fetch a TanStack documentation page by library and path."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack doc <library> <path> [options]","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--docs-version <version>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Docs version (default: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"latest"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--json"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output machine-readable JSON"}]}]]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack doc router framework/react/guide/data-loading\ntanstack doc query framework/react/overview --docs-version v5 --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-search-docs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack search-docs"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search TanStack documentation."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack search-docs <query> [options]","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--library <id>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filter by library ID"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--framework <name>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filter by framework"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--limit <n>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Max results (default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"10"},{"type":"text","value":", max "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"50"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--json"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output machine-readable JSON"}]}]]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start\ntanstack search-docs loaders --library router --framework react --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-ecosystem","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack ecosystem"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"List ecosystem partner recommendations."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack ecosystem [options]","lang":"bash"},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--category <category>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filter by category"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--library <id>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filter by TanStack library"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--json"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Output machine-readable JSON"}]}]]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack ecosystem --category database\ntanstack ecosystem --library router --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tanstack-pin-versions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"tanstack pin-versions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pin TanStack package versions to avoid conflicts."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack pin-versions","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Removes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"^"},{"type":"text","value":" from version ranges for TanStack packages and adds any missing peer dependencies."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Projects include "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".cta.json"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"projectName\": \"my-app\",\n  \"framework\": \"react\",\n  \"mode\": \"file-router\",\n  \"typescript\": true,\n  \"tailwind\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm\",\n  \"chosenAddOns\": [\"tanstack-query\", \"clerk\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Used by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"add-on init"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"template init"},{"type":"text","value":" to detect changes."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"tanstack-create","text":"tanstack create","level":2},{"id":"programmatic-generation","text":"Programmatic generation","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-add","text":"tanstack add","level":2},{"id":"tanstack-add-on","text":"tanstack add-on","level":2},{"id":"init","text":"init","level":3},{"id":"compile","text":"compile","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-template","text":"tanstack template","level":2},{"id":"init-2","text":"init","level":3},{"id":"compile-2","text":"compile","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-libraries","text":"tanstack libraries","level":2},{"id":"tanstack-doc","text":"tanstack doc","level":2},{"id":"tanstack-search-docs","text":"tanstack search-docs","level":2},{"id":"tanstack-ecosystem","text":"tanstack ecosystem","level":2},{"id":"tanstack-pin-versions","text":"tanstack pin-versions","level":2},{"id":"configuration","text":"Configuration","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## tanstack create\n\nCreate a new TanStack application. By default creates a TanStack Start app with SSR.\n\n```bash\ntanstack create [project-name] [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--add-ons <ids>` | Comma-separated add-on IDs |\n| `--template <url-or-id>` | Template URL/path or built-in template ID |\n| `--blank` | Create a minimal one-route Start project without default starter UI, examples, Tailwind, devtools, or a test stack |\n| `--package-manager <pm>` | `npm`, `pnpm`, `yarn`, `bun`, `deno` |\n| `--framework <name>` | `React`, `Solid` |\n| `--router-only` | Create file-based Router-only app without TanStack Start (add-ons/deployment/template disabled) |\n| `--toolchain <id>` | Toolchain add-on (use `--list-add-ons` to see options) |\n| `--deployment <id>` | Deployment add-on (use `--list-add-ons` to see options) |\n| `--examples` / `--no-examples` | Include or exclude demo/example pages |\n| `--tailwind` / `--no-tailwind` | Deprecated compatibility flags for standard projects; blank projects omit Tailwind |\n| `--no-git` | Skip git init |\n| `--no-install` | Skip dependency install |\n| `-y, --yes` | Use defaults, skip prompts |\n| `--interactive` | Force interactive mode |\n| `--target-dir <path>` | Custom output directory |\n| `-f, --force` | Overwrite existing directory |\n| `--list-add-ons` | List all available add-ons |\n| `--addon-details <id>` | Show details for specific add-on |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON for automation |\n| `--add-on-config <json>` | JSON string with add-on options |\n\n```bash\n# Examples\ntanstack create my-app -y\ntanstack create my-app --blank -y\ntanstack create my-app --blank --deployment cloudflare -y\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons clerk,drizzle,tanstack-query\ntanstack create my-app --router-only --toolchain eslint --no-examples\ntanstack create my-app --template https://example.com/template.json\ntanstack create my-app --template ecommerce\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json\ntanstack create --addon-details drizzle --framework React --json\n```\n\n`--blank` creates the smallest useful TanStack Start project: one route and no\ndefault starter interface, examples, Tailwind, devtools, test dependencies, or\nTanStack Intent setup. Pass `--intent` when the project should include local\nskill mappings for coding agents.\nExplicit add-ons and deployment adapters can add their own required files and\ndependencies. Add `-y` to use defaults for every remaining option; when the\ntarget is non-empty, also pass `--force` or the command exits without writing.\n\n### Programmatic generation\n\nUse `@tanstack/create/worker` in Cloudflare Workers and other edge SSR runtimes. It does not import the generated template manifest at module startup. Instead, provide a loader for the framework and add-on chunks your Worker supports.\n\nThe default `@tanstack/create` export is still the Node/CLI path and scans framework templates from disk. `@tanstack/create/edge` remains the bundled in-memory manifest path; it is Worker-compatible at runtime, but it imports the full generated manifest and is not appropriate for size-constrained Worker bundles.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  createMemoryEnvironment,\n  createWorkerCreate,\n  createWorkerManifestLoader,\n} from '@tanstack/create/worker'\nimport { manifestCatalog } from '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/catalog'\n\nimport type {\n  WorkerAddOnManifestModule,\n  WorkerFrameworkManifestModule,\n} from '@tanstack/create/worker'\n\nconst frameworkLoaders: Record<\n  string,\n  () => Promise<WorkerFrameworkManifestModule>\n> = {\n  react: () => import('@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react'),\n}\n\nconst addOnLoaders: Record<\n  string,\n  Record<string, () => Promise<WorkerAddOnManifestModule>>\n> = {\n  react: {\n    'tanstack-query': () =>\n      import(\n        '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react/add-ons/tanstack-query'\n      ),\n    cloudflare: () =>\n      import(\n        '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react/add-ons/cloudflare'\n      ),\n  },\n}\n\nconst create = createWorkerCreate(\n  createWorkerManifestLoader({\n    loadCatalog: async () => manifestCatalog,\n    async loadFramework(frameworkId) {\n      const load = frameworkLoaders[frameworkId]\n      if (!load) throw new Error(`Unsupported framework: ${frameworkId}`)\n      return load()\n    },\n    async loadAddOn(frameworkId, addOnId) {\n      const load = addOnLoaders[frameworkId]?.[addOnId]\n      if (!load) throw new Error(`Unsupported add-on: ${addOnId}`)\n      return load()\n    },\n  }),\n)\n\nconst framework = await create.getFrameworkById('react')\nconst chosenAddOns = await create.finalizeAddOns(framework!, 'file-router', [\n  'tanstack-query',\n  'cloudflare',\n])\nconst addOnOptions = create.populateAddOnOptionsDefaults(chosenAddOns)\nconst { environment, output } = createMemoryEnvironment('/app')\n\nawait create.createApp(environment, {\n  projectName: 'app',\n  targetDir: '/app',\n  framework: framework!,\n  mode: 'file-router',\n  typescript: true,\n  tailwind: true,\n  packageManager: 'pnpm',\n  git: false,\n  install: false,\n  intent: false,\n  chosenAddOns,\n  addOnOptions,\n})\n\n// output.files contains generated files for ZIP creation.\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack add\n\nAdd add-ons to an existing project.\n\n```bash\ntanstack add [add-on...] [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--forced` | Force add-on installation even if conflicts exist |\n\n```bash\n# Examples\ntanstack add clerk drizzle\ntanstack add tanstack-query,tanstack-form\n```\n\nVisual setup is available at `https://tanstack.com/builder`.\n\n---\n\n## tanstack add-on\n\nCreate and manage custom add-ons.\n\n### init\n\nExtract add-on from current project:\n\n```bash\ntanstack add-on init\n```\n\nCreates `.add-on/` folder with `info.json` and `assets/`.\n\n### compile\n\nRebuild after changes:\n\n```bash\ntanstack add-on compile\n```\n\nSee [Creating Add-ons](./creating-add-ons.md) for full guide.\n\n---\n\n## tanstack template\n\nCreate reusable project templates.\n\n### init\n\n```bash\ntanstack template init\n```\n\nCreates `template-info.json` and `template.json`.\n\n### compile\n\n```bash\ntanstack template compile\n```\n\nSee [Templates](./templates.md) for full guide.\n\n## tanstack libraries\n\nList TanStack libraries with optional group filtering.\n\n```bash\ntanstack libraries [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--group <group>` | Filter by group: `state`, `headlessUI`, `performance`, `tooling` |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack libraries\ntanstack libraries --group state --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack doc\n\nFetch a TanStack documentation page by library and path.\n\n```bash\ntanstack doc <library> <path> [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--docs-version <version>` | Docs version (default: `latest`) |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack doc router framework/react/guide/data-loading\ntanstack doc query framework/react/overview --docs-version v5 --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack search-docs\n\nSearch TanStack documentation.\n\n```bash\ntanstack search-docs <query> [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--library <id>` | Filter by library ID |\n| `--framework <name>` | Filter by framework |\n| `--limit <n>` | Max results (default `10`, max `50`) |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start\ntanstack search-docs loaders --library router --framework react --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack ecosystem\n\nList ecosystem partner recommendations.\n\n```bash\ntanstack ecosystem [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--category <category>` | Filter by category |\n| `--library <id>` | Filter by TanStack library |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack ecosystem --category database\ntanstack ecosystem --library router --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack pin-versions\n\nPin TanStack package versions to avoid conflicts.\n\n```bash\ntanstack pin-versions\n```\n\nRemoves `^` from version ranges for TanStack packages and adds any missing peer dependencies.\n\n---\n\n## Configuration\n\nProjects include `.cta.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"projectName\": \"my-app\",\n  \"framework\": \"react\",\n  \"mode\": \"file-router\",\n  \"typescript\": true,\n  \"tailwind\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm\",\n  \"chosenAddOns\": [\"tanstack-query\", \"clerk\"]\n}\n```\n\nUsed by `add-on init` and `template init` to detect changes.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: cli-reference\ntitle: CLI Reference\n---\n\n## tanstack create\n\nCreate a new TanStack application. By default creates a TanStack Start app with SSR.\n\n```bash\ntanstack create [project-name] [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--add-ons <ids>` | Comma-separated add-on IDs |\n| `--template <url-or-id>` | Template URL/path or built-in template ID |\n| `--blank` | Create a minimal one-route Start project without default starter UI, examples, Tailwind, devtools, or a test stack |\n| `--package-manager <pm>` | `npm`, `pnpm`, `yarn`, `bun`, `deno` |\n| `--framework <name>` | `React`, `Solid` |\n| `--router-only` | Create file-based Router-only app without TanStack Start (add-ons/deployment/template disabled) |\n| `--toolchain <id>` | Toolchain add-on (use `--list-add-ons` to see options) |\n| `--deployment <id>` | Deployment add-on (use `--list-add-ons` to see options) |\n| `--examples` / `--no-examples` | Include or exclude demo/example pages |\n| `--tailwind` / `--no-tailwind` | Deprecated compatibility flags for standard projects; blank projects omit Tailwind |\n| `--no-git` | Skip git init |\n| `--no-install` | Skip dependency install |\n| `-y, --yes` | Use defaults, skip prompts |\n| `--interactive` | Force interactive mode |\n| `--target-dir <path>` | Custom output directory |\n| `-f, --force` | Overwrite existing directory |\n| `--list-add-ons` | List all available add-ons |\n| `--addon-details <id>` | Show details for specific add-on |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON for automation |\n| `--add-on-config <json>` | JSON string with add-on options |\n\n```bash\n# Examples\ntanstack create my-app -y\ntanstack create my-app --blank -y\ntanstack create my-app --blank --deployment cloudflare -y\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons clerk,drizzle,tanstack-query\ntanstack create my-app --router-only --toolchain eslint --no-examples\ntanstack create my-app --template https://example.com/template.json\ntanstack create my-app --template ecommerce\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --framework React --json\ntanstack create --addon-details drizzle --framework React --json\n```\n\n`--blank` creates the smallest useful TanStack Start project: one route and no\ndefault starter interface, examples, Tailwind, devtools, test dependencies, or\nTanStack Intent setup. Pass `--intent` when the project should include local\nskill mappings for coding agents.\nExplicit add-ons and deployment adapters can add their own required files and\ndependencies. Add `-y` to use defaults for every remaining option; when the\ntarget is non-empty, also pass `--force` or the command exits without writing.\n\n### Programmatic generation\n\nUse `@tanstack/create/worker` in Cloudflare Workers and other edge SSR runtimes. It does not import the generated template manifest at module startup. Instead, provide a loader for the framework and add-on chunks your Worker supports.\n\nThe default `@tanstack/create` export is still the Node/CLI path and scans framework templates from disk. `@tanstack/create/edge` remains the bundled in-memory manifest path; it is Worker-compatible at runtime, but it imports the full generated manifest and is not appropriate for size-constrained Worker bundles.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  createMemoryEnvironment,\n  createWorkerCreate,\n  createWorkerManifestLoader,\n} from '@tanstack/create/worker'\nimport { manifestCatalog } from '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/catalog'\n\nimport type {\n  WorkerAddOnManifestModule,\n  WorkerFrameworkManifestModule,\n} from '@tanstack/create/worker'\n\nconst frameworkLoaders: Record<\n  string,\n  () => Promise<WorkerFrameworkManifestModule>\n> = {\n  react: () => import('@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react'),\n}\n\nconst addOnLoaders: Record<\n  string,\n  Record<string, () => Promise<WorkerAddOnManifestModule>>\n> = {\n  react: {\n    'tanstack-query': () =>\n      import(\n        '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react/add-ons/tanstack-query'\n      ),\n    cloudflare: () =>\n      import(\n        '@tanstack/create/worker-manifest/frameworks/react/add-ons/cloudflare'\n      ),\n  },\n}\n\nconst create = createWorkerCreate(\n  createWorkerManifestLoader({\n    loadCatalog: async () => manifestCatalog,\n    async loadFramework(frameworkId) {\n      const load = frameworkLoaders[frameworkId]\n      if (!load) throw new Error(`Unsupported framework: ${frameworkId}`)\n      return load()\n    },\n    async loadAddOn(frameworkId, addOnId) {\n      const load = addOnLoaders[frameworkId]?.[addOnId]\n      if (!load) throw new Error(`Unsupported add-on: ${addOnId}`)\n      return load()\n    },\n  }),\n)\n\nconst framework = await create.getFrameworkById('react')\nconst chosenAddOns = await create.finalizeAddOns(framework!, 'file-router', [\n  'tanstack-query',\n  'cloudflare',\n])\nconst addOnOptions = create.populateAddOnOptionsDefaults(chosenAddOns)\nconst { environment, output } = createMemoryEnvironment('/app')\n\nawait create.createApp(environment, {\n  projectName: 'app',\n  targetDir: '/app',\n  framework: framework!,\n  mode: 'file-router',\n  typescript: true,\n  tailwind: true,\n  packageManager: 'pnpm',\n  git: false,\n  install: false,\n  intent: false,\n  chosenAddOns,\n  addOnOptions,\n})\n\n// output.files contains generated files for ZIP creation.\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack add\n\nAdd add-ons to an existing project.\n\n```bash\ntanstack add [add-on...] [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--forced` | Force add-on installation even if conflicts exist |\n\n```bash\n# Examples\ntanstack add clerk drizzle\ntanstack add tanstack-query,tanstack-form\n```\n\nVisual setup is available at `https://tanstack.com/builder`.\n\n---\n\n## tanstack add-on\n\nCreate and manage custom add-ons.\n\n### init\n\nExtract add-on from current project:\n\n```bash\ntanstack add-on init\n```\n\nCreates `.add-on/` folder with `info.json` and `assets/`.\n\n### compile\n\nRebuild after changes:\n\n```bash\ntanstack add-on compile\n```\n\nSee [Creating Add-ons](./creating-add-ons.md) for full guide.\n\n---\n\n## tanstack template\n\nCreate reusable project templates.\n\n### init\n\n```bash\ntanstack template init\n```\n\nCreates `template-info.json` and `template.json`.\n\n### compile\n\n```bash\ntanstack template compile\n```\n\nSee [Templates](./templates.md) for full guide.\n\n## tanstack libraries\n\nList TanStack libraries with optional group filtering.\n\n```bash\ntanstack libraries [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--group <group>` | Filter by group: `state`, `headlessUI`, `performance`, `tooling` |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack libraries\ntanstack libraries --group state --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack doc\n\nFetch a TanStack documentation page by library and path.\n\n```bash\ntanstack doc <library> <path> [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--docs-version <version>` | Docs version (default: `latest`) |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack doc router framework/react/guide/data-loading\ntanstack doc query framework/react/overview --docs-version v5 --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack search-docs\n\nSearch TanStack documentation.\n\n```bash\ntanstack search-docs <query> [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--library <id>` | Filter by library ID |\n| `--framework <name>` | Filter by framework |\n| `--limit <n>` | Max results (default `10`, max `50`) |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start\ntanstack search-docs loaders --library router --framework react --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack ecosystem\n\nList ecosystem partner recommendations.\n\n```bash\ntanstack ecosystem [options]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--category <category>` | Filter by category |\n| `--library <id>` | Filter by TanStack library |\n| `--json` | Output machine-readable JSON |\n\n```bash\ntanstack ecosystem --category database\ntanstack ecosystem --library router --json\n```\n\n---\n\n## tanstack pin-versions\n\nPin TanStack package versions to avoid conflicts.\n\n```bash\ntanstack pin-versions\n```\n\nRemoves `^` from version ranges for TanStack packages and adds any missing peer dependencies.\n\n---\n\n## Configuration\n\nProjects include `.cta.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"projectName\": \"my-app\",\n  \"framework\": \"react\",\n  \"mode\": \"file-router\",\n  \"typescript\": true,\n  \"tailwind\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm\",\n  \"chosenAddOns\": [\"tanstack-query\", \"clerk\"]\n}\n```\n\nUsed by `add-on init` and `template init` to detect changes.\n"}
